          "completion": {
            "text": "{\n  \"title\": \"Region 31 Daily Dispatch\",\n  \"subtitle\": \"June 2, 2026\",\n  \"main_story\": {\n    \"headline\": \"Confusion persists regarding status of north quarry operations\",\n    \"lede\": \"Conflicting accounts emerged regarding the operational status of the north quarry following its scheduled closure.\",\n    \"body\": \"Operational status at the north quarry became a point of contention late yesterday evening. **Uma** maintained that the facility reached its official closure at 20:00 UTC, citing a formal notice posted at the administration office as verification.\\n\\nContradicting this assessment, **Vik** reported witnessing continued activity at the site. According to these observations, the north quarry gate remained open to traffic after the designated time, with at least two loaded carts entering the premises after 20:00 UTC. The discrepancy between the posted *closure notice* and the observed gate activity remains unresolved.\"\n  },\n  \"announcements\": []\n}",
